<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>季节调治 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%AD%A3%E8%8A%82%E8%B0%83%E6%B2%BB/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 05:12:47 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%AD%A3%E8%8A%82%E8%B0%83%E6%B2%BB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>诊要经终论篇第十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE16%E8%AF%8A%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%88%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE16%E8%AF%8A%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%88%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯系统论述了四时人气运行规律及相应针刺治疗法则：春气在肝宜浅刺络脉，夏气在头当刺孙络，秋气在肺须循腠理，冬气在肾必取背俞。强调&amp;quot;因时施治&amp;quot;的核心理念，指出误用季节刺法将导致&amp;quot;邪气深入&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;气血逆乱&amp;quot;等严重后果。继而详细阐明误用刺法的十二种不良转归，如春用夏刺则伤气、夏用秋刺易惊等。最后完整论述了太阳、少阳、阳明、少阴、太阴、厥阴六经气绝时的特征性临床表现及其预后判断要点，为中医诊断治疗提供了重要的理论基础和实践指导。全文深刻揭示了&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的整体观念在针灸诊疗中的关键作用。</description></item></channel></rss>